\details{
Logs of zero are undefined, so every log-ratio method, such as
\code{norm = 'clr'}, \code{\link[=aitchison]{aitchison()}}, \code{\link[=alr]{alr()}} and \code{\link[=ilr]{ilr()}}, needs the zeros dealt
